rog-dovi-map (0.1.0+rogdv1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New GStreamer-free mapping core, extracted from libgstgtk-dovi-core
    0.1.0+rogdv11 with its rules unchanged: stream and picture
    qualification, Profile 5 without a base fallback, target validation,
    the provider call order and transport gain, the SDR destination and
    the process-shared Vulkan device with its off-thread teardown.
  * Host-plane and DRM-PRIME DMABuf input through pl_map_avframe_ex,
    host or GBM-allocated DMABuf output, device selection by render node
    (none means libplacebo's default), decline reasons, provider reset,
    profile capability and a validated metadata blob.

